        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="ECf retr 2.8"><pb n="629" ed="#liebermann"/>Item<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="12" target="#ECfRetr_2-8.lnote.la.12"/> omnibus Christianis ad ecclesiam causa orationis <hi rend="bold">euntibus</hi><ptr type="liebermannNote" n="13" target="#ECfRetr_2-8.lnote.la.13"/><hi rend="bold">:</hi> pax in eundo et redeundo sit <hi rend="bold">eis; similiter</hi> ad dedicationes, ad synodos, ad capitula <hi rend="bold">uenientibus,</hi> siue submoniti sint<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="14" target="#ECfRetr_2-8.lnote.la.14"/>, siue<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="15" target="#ECfRetr_2-8.lnote.la.15"/> per<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="16" target="#ECfRetr_2-8.lnote.la.16"/> se quid<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="17" target="#ECfRetr_2-8.lnote.la.17"/> agendum habuerint, <hi rend="bold">sit</hi><ptr type="liebermannNote" n="18" target="#ECfRetr_2-8.lnote.la.18"/> <hi rend="bold">pax</hi><ptr type="liebermannNote" n="19" target="#ECfRetr_2-8.lnote.la.19"/> <hi rend="bold">summa.</hi></ab>
